  "default" : "<p><strong>Most segmentation strategies are well designed. The problem is execution.</strong></p><p>As environments expand across campus, branch, data center, and cloud, policy intent fails to keep up with how the network actually changes. Visibility fragments. Access paths multiply. Enforcement breaks down at the places your design did not account for.</p><p>We assess your environment before we recommend anything. We design the segmentation fabric to match how your organization operates — not a reference architecture built for a different environment. We deploy with defined milestones, documented deliverables, and clear reporting throughout.</p><p>And we stay accountable after go-live. Because the fabric is only as good as how it holds up over time.</p>"
